Get benchmark and fund performance statistics.

## Example Request (Benchmark and Fund Performance)

```json
{
    "date_range": {
        "start_date": "2025-01-01",
        "end_date": "2025-10-09"
    },
    "fund_names": ["Flagship"],
    "benchmark_names": ["IWM US Equity"]
}

Get performance overview with time-series cumulative metrics.

Supports three metrics via the `metric` field:
- `cumulative_pnl_percent_nav` (default): Geometric cumulative PnL as % of NAV
- `cumulative_simple_alpha_pnl_percent_nav`: PnL% minus benchmark cumulative return
- `cumulative_net_adjusted_alpha_pnl_percent_nav`: PnL% minus (benchmark% × avg net exposure%)

Alpha metrics require a `benchmark_id` (defaults to the configured default).
When grouping by analyst, include the corresponding avatar column.

## Example Request (default: cumulative PnL % NAV)

```json
{
    "date_range": {
        "start_date": "2025-01-01",
        "end_date": "2025-12-01"
    },
    "filters": {},
    "group_by": ["date", "fund_name"],
    "sort": {
        "sort_by": ["date"],
        "sort_descending": false
    }
}
```

## Example Request (simple alpha vs XBI)

```json
{
    "date_range": {
        "start_date": "2025-01-01",
        "end_date": "2025-12-01"
    },
    "filters": {},
    "group_by": ["date", "direction"],
    "metric": "cumulative_simple_alpha_pnl_percent_nav",
    "benchmark_id": "XBI US Equity",
    "sort": {
        "sort_by": ["date"],
        "sort_descending": false
    }
}
```

## Example Request (net adjusted alpha)

```json
{
    "date_range": {
        "start_date": "2025-01-01",
        "end_date": "2025-12-01"
    },
    "filters": {"fund_name": ["Flagship"]},
    "group_by": ["date", "fund_name"],
    "metric": "cumulative_net_adjusted_alpha_pnl_percent_nav",
    "benchmark_id": "SPX Index",
    "sort": {
        "sort_by": ["date"],
        "sort_descending": false
    }
}
```

Get basket breakdown statistics at all drill-down hierarchy levels.

Returns 2 datasets in a single response for accordion UI:
1. Grouped by position_instrument_security_code (basket level)
2. Grouped by position_instrument_security_code + instrument_security_code (underlying level)

Each entry has its own metadata with `group_by` indicating the hierarchy level.

**Note:** By default, this endpoint filters to `position_instrument_asset_type: ["BASKET"]`.

## Example Request

```json
{
    "date_range": {
        "start_date": "2025-01-01",
        "end_date": "2025-12-30"
    },
    "filters": {
        "fund_name": ["Flagship"]
    },
    "sort": {
        "sort_by": ["company_netted_gmv_percent_nav"],
        "sort_descending": true
    }
}
```

## Example Response

```json
[
    {
        "data": [
            {"position_instrument_security_code": "Tech Basket", "gross_exposure_percent": 0.25, "cumulative_pnl_percent_nav": 0.08},
            {"position_instrument_security_code": "Healthcare Basket", "gross_exposure_percent": 0.15, "cumulative_pnl_percent_nav": 0.03}
        ],
        "metadata": {"group_by": ["position_instrument_security_code"], "record_count": 2, ...}
    },
    {
        "data": [
            {"position_instrument_security_code": "Tech Basket", "instrument_security_code": "AAPL", "gross_exposure_percent": 0.15, "cumulative_pnl_percent_nav": 0.05},
            {"position_instrument_security_code": "Tech Basket", "instrument_security_code": "MSFT", "gross_exposure_percent": 0.10, "cumulative_pnl_percent_nav": 0.03},
            ...
        ],
        "metadata": {"group_by": ["position_instrument_security_code", "instrument_security_code"], "record_count": 5, ...}
    }
]
```

Get heat maps statistics with net exposure percent and cumulative PnL.

This endpoint calculates net_exposure_percent and cumulative_pnl_percent_nav
grouped by company_security_code_portfolio_asset_class and one breakdown dimension.

The `group_by` parameter must contain exactly 2 items:
- `company_security_code_portfolio_asset_class` (required)
- One breakdown dimension: `company_netted_direction`, `direction`, `fund_name`, `company_subsector`,
  `instrument_portfolio_asset_class`, or `illiquid_private`

## Example Request (grouped by company_security_code_portfolio_asset_class and company_netted_direction - default)

```json
{
    "date_range": {
        "start_date": "2024-01-01",
        "end_date": "2025-01-02"
    }
}
```

## Example Request (grouped by company_security_code_portfolio_asset_class and fund_name)

```json
{
    "date_range": {
        "start_date": "2024-01-01",
        "end_date": "2025-01-02"
    },
    "group_by": ["company_security_code_portfolio_asset_class", "fund_name"]
}
```

Get portfolio summary statistics at all drill-down hierarchy levels.

Returns 4 datasets in a single response for accordion UI:
1. Grouped by company_security_code_portfolio_asset_class
2. Grouped by company_security_code_portfolio_asset_class + instrument_security_code
3. Grouped by company_security_code_portfolio_asset_class + instrument_security_code + position_instrument_security_code
4. Grouped by company_security_code_portfolio_asset_class + instrument_security_code + position_instrument_security_code + primary_analyst

Each entry has its own metadata with `group_by` indicating the hierarchy level.

## Example Request

```json
{
    "date_range": {
        "start_date": "2025-01-01",
        "end_date": "2025-12-31"
    },
    "filters": {
        "fund_name": ["Flagship", "Innovation"]
    },
    "sort": {
        "sort_by": ["net_exposure"],
        "sort_descending": true
    }
}
```

## Example Response

```json
[
    {
        "data": [
            {"company_security_code_portfolio_asset_class": "Equity", "net_exposure": 50000000, "cumulative_pnl": 1500000, ...},
            {"company_security_code_portfolio_asset_class": "Fixed Income", "net_exposure": 20000000, "cumulative_pnl": 300000, ...}
        ],
        "metadata": {"group_by": ["company_security_code_portfolio_asset_class"], "record_count": 2, ...}
    },
    {
        "data": [
            {"company_security_code_portfolio_asset_class": "Equity", "instrument_security_code": "AAPL", "net_exposure": 30000000, ...},
            {"company_security_code_portfolio_asset_class": "Equity", "instrument_security_code": "MSFT", "net_exposure": 20000000, ...},
            {"company_security_code_portfolio_asset_class": "Fixed Income", "instrument_security_code": "UST 10Y", "net_exposure": 20000000, ...}
        ],
        "metadata": {"group_by": ["company_security_code_portfolio_asset_class", "instrument_security_code"], "record_count": 3, ...}
    },
    ...
]
```

