based on the provided date range and filters.

## Example Request

```json
{
    "date_range": {
        "start_date": "2026-01-01",
        "end_date": "2026-01-08"
    },
    "filters": {}
}
```

## Example Request with direction filter

```json
{
    "date_range": {
        "start_date": "2026-01-01",
        "end_date": "2026-01-08"
    },
    "filters": {
        "direction": ["Long"]
    }
}
```

