Get fund breakdown statistics - returns [summary, detail].

Returns a list of 2 responses:
- [0] Summary: 7 rows (one per section), each with name and exposure_percent
- [1] Detail: all detail rows across 7 sections, with grouped_metric_value

Sections: Gross Long, Illiquid Privates, Gross Short, Net Exposure,
Gross Exposure, Total Long, Minnows.

## Example Request

```json
{
    "date_range": {
        "start_date": "2026-01-01",
        "end_date": "2026-01-08"
    },
    "filters": {}
}
```

## Example Response

```json
[
    {
        "metadata": {"record_count": 7, "display_columns": ["name", "exposure_percent"]},
        "data": [
            {"name": "Gross Long", "exposure_percent": 0.55},
            {"name": "Illiquid Privates", "exposure_percent": 0.10},
            {"name": "Gross Short", "exposure_percent": -0.20},
            {"name": "Net Exposure", "exposure_percent": 0.45},
            {"name": "Gross Exposure", "exposure_percent": 0.65},
            {"name": "Total Long", "exposure_percent": 0.60},
            {"name": "Minnows", "exposure_percent": 0.05}
        ]
